id: arboreal-second-effect
name: Arboreal: Ki Surge
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: arboreal
fromEffect: 2
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Arboreal's second effect, as a Maneuver: a stack of Sunlight for a Ki Surge.
text: >
  (2)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action, you may spend a stack of Sunlight to use a Ki Surge.

---

# A stack of Sunlight spent, the Ki Surge (chat.mjs arborealSurge) - none held, nothing done.
[on used]
arborealSurge();
